      "knowledge_access": "[CHARACTER KNOWLEDGE ACCESS]\nFacts: F1 campaign_fact_nicco_light_mage \"Nicco is a Light mage.\" | F2 campaign_fact_nicco_otherworlder \"Nicco came to this world from another world.\"\nNarration and Nicco (player): F1, F2. Nicco's speech and decisions still belong to the player.\nSister Mereth: CAN USE none; DO NOT USE F1, F2\nA character may voice or act on only the facts listed CAN USE for them (believes/suspects/heard_rumor: only as belief, suspicion or rumor). DO NOT USE also covers hints, rumors, \"everyone says\" talk and claims that imply the fact; do not invent rumors or public talk to get around it. DO NOT USE is this turn's permission, not proof of ignorance: that character may ask, say they have not heard, or defer to someone who can use it.",
      "scene_section": "[CURRENT AUTHORITATIVE SCENE]\nLocation: Heartstone Square. Heartstone's massive main entrance opens directly onto this public square, outside the tower's structure. The square is reasonably broad but is not a major civic square. Moderate daytime foot traffic is quieter than at Main Market Square. Low residential buildings predominate, with few nearby shops and no major commercial concentration. Night safety is mediocre. The low-end, disreputable tavern The Coined Lie faces or directly adjoins the square. The White Basin is a laundry near Heartstone, without an established position directly on the square.\nWorld minute: 0. Player mana: 100/100.\nLocal ancestry and features: {\"ancestry\":[{\"id\":\"calderan_west\",\"name\":\"West District\",\"display_name\":\"Calderan West District\",\"summary\":\"West District is a large, dense and socially mixed region of Calderan, with ordinary families, manual labor, workshops, warehouses, cheap businesses and respectable shops alongside poverty, debt, crime and legal slavery-related commerce.\",\"secret\":false},{\"id\":\"calderan\",\"name\":\"Calderan\",\"display_name\":\"Calderan\",\"summary\":\"Calderan is West's inland capital, main political center, and main campaign city.\",\"secret\":false},{\"id\":\"west\",\"name\":\"West\",\"display_name\":\"West (nation)\",\"summary\":\"West is the western nation, broadly mild, temperate, and greener; Calderan is its capital.\",\"secret\":false},{\"id\":\"continent\",\"name\":\"Known Continent\",\"display_name\":\"Known Continent\",\"summary\":\"An enormous known continent comprises West, Center, and East, arranged from west to east.\",\"secret\":false}],\"features\":[{\"name\":\"Heartstone main entrance\",\"description\":\"Heartstone's massive, old, heavy wooden main entrance faces this area and opens directly into LR.\"}]}\n[NICCO / PLAYER PROFILE]\nNarrator-facing truth about the player character, not NPC knowledge. Others may perceive only his observable appearance; any other detail here is usable by an NPC only when [CHARACTER KNOWLEDGE ACCESS] lists it for them. Nicco's dialogue, thoughts, intentions and deliberate actions come only from the player.\nNicco is a 35-year-old human man. He was transported into this world from another world approximately one day before the campaign begins, and he has essentially no prior lived knowledge of this world unless explicitly established later. On arrival he became the lawful owner/holder of Heartstone Tower. He is tall and overweight, with a few visible white hairs and very mild, early balding; no further appearance details are established. His magical affinity/school is Light. His currently known Light subschools are healing and sacrifice, understood only within the existing magic framework; no mechanics for sacrifice are established. Being a Light mage gives him no automatic knowledge of spells, institutions, lore, or magical theory. Nicco is the player character: his dialogue, thoughts, intentions, and deliberate actions are supplied only by the player.\nHousehold: Heartstone (owner).\n[CURRENT AUTHORITATIVE CHARACTERS]\nPortrayal fields guide NPC behavior only. Purpose is not a campaign goal. Morality/private notes/personality never grant Nicco or other NPCs knowledge; do not recite them as public facts.\nCharacter Nicco (nicco): {\"profile\":{\"name\":\"Nicco\",\"aliases\":[]},\"current\":{\"current_location\":\"heartstone_square\"},\"canonical_awareness\":[]}\nCharacter Sister Mereth (sister_mereth): {\"baseline\":{\"id\":\"sister_mereth\",\"name\":\"Sister Mereth\",\"display_name\":\"Sister Mereth\",\"summary\":\"Sister Mereth administers Saint Orra's House and is its principal public representative.\",\"secret\":false,\"appearance\":\"Short and solid, with grey hair tied back, a severe tired face and simple clothing. Carries a large key ring and a document/account bag.\",\"portrayal\":{\"purpose\":\"Keep Saint Orra's House operating and provide food, shelter, basic trade training/apprenticeship and a path away from street survival.\",\"morality\":\"Generally caring and strongly pragmatic. May accept morally uncomfortable compromises when she believes the alternative is worse. Her contact with Elara remains ambiguous and does not establish a crime or a solution to the disappearances.\",\"personality\":[\"practical\",\"strict\",\"organized\",\"brusque\",\"deeply knowledgeable about children under her care\",\"distrustful of vague promises\"],\"affiliations\":[],\"private_notes\":\"Keeps unusually accurate records distinguishing disappeared, adopted, placed, apprenticed and dead children. No individual entries are supplied. Strong knowledge of West children, families, disappearances and small-scale child crime; weak knowledge of upper organized crime. Does not know Dren. Blackthorn may be only a rumor or name. No specific private suspicion is established.\",\"authority\":\"narrator_portrayal_only_not_character_knowledge\"},\"content\":\"Sister Mereth keeps Saint Orra's House functioning and seeks food, shelter, basic trade training or apprenticeship and a path away from street survival for its children. She knows the children under her care deeply and distrusts vague promises. Her relationship with Elara remains morally ambiguous. Reported disappearances remain unexplained; neither Elara nor any other cause or culprit is established. No exact residence is supplied.\",\"traits\":[\"practical\",\"strict\",\"organized\",\"brusque\",\"deeply knowledgeable about children under her care\",\"distrustful of vague promises\"]},\"profile\":{\"name\":\"Sister Mereth\",\"aliases\":[]},\"current\":{\"current_location\":\"heartstone_square\"},\"canonical_awareness\":[]}\n[CURRENT EQUIPMENT]\nVisible carried/equipped items (ownership and positions are authoritative): []\nScheduled events: []",
